  "sourceTitle": "Tomato Pickles",
  "sourceText": "Tomato Pickles\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Sunday, February 14, 2010 - 3:41am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n30 lrgs Ripe tomatoes\n4 lrgs Onions\n6 lrgs Pears\n6 lrgs Peaches\n6 lrgs Apples\n4 cups Granulated sugar\n2 tablespoons Salt\n1 pkt Mixed pickling spices, tied in cloth\n1 pint Vinegar\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Peel and chop fine the tomatoes, omions, pears, peaches and apples. Mix all ingredients and boil until thick. Pour into sterilized KERR jars and seal.",
